{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101974","id":2295939269,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6I2UDF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101974","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101974.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101974.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101974","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101974/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101974/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101974/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f10cc8f0e03e07ba8b17d6c1af8b83de6595d54","number":101974,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use \"literal\" term where appropriate in shader language internals and in error messages.","user":{"login":"maxpiepenbrink","id":240875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink","html_url":"https://github.com/maxpiepenbrink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\nPreviously we were using \"constant\" to describe all instances of immutable declarations, whether that was an inline literal or an actual declared constant variable. This lack of disambiguation also resulted in some misleading error messages, ie: \"expected integer constant\" where only a literal is actually valid (and passing an actual constant like PI would fail with that exact error message).\r\n\r\nThis also improves a few error messages that only stated the expectation of an integer constant when it was more appropriate to say an integer OR float literal. This was originally brought up here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101926\r\n\r\nIf this gets a green light I'll also take a stab at shoring up the docs to see if there's improvements to be made around \"constant\" vs \"literal\".\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-beta1_win64_Cq0W3xbX6Z](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43dba1ff-3f53-43de-b18a-a402592ddf54)\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n![godot windows editor dev x86_64_MLxbNq5qr4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1731c45c-ab99-46fb-abc1-94b3860cbe54)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZ